## Third-party components

MatterHelm bundles open-source components, including matter.js, zod, and pino
in the sidecar, Node.js as its runtime, and QRCoder in the tray app.
The self-contained .NET publish bundles the .NET runtime (MIT, Microsoft).
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt` ships with the binary distribution and contains the
exact bundled versions, declared licenses, and license/notice text.
